window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>What happens when Caden and Summer get a camper and take an adventure?</b></p> <p>When they run into Shay and Kennedy Coleman?</p> <p>Well, they meet a half-angel, a mostly demonic demon, and... mermaids?</p> <p>Get ready for one crossover adventure from Anti-Stepbrother, Hate To Love You, and Evil not to be missed! Two bonus short stories from Evil are included.</p>"; 
